<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to February 14.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   North Flinders	     7.85	    16.32</p>
<p>2   CSL			    6.30	     9.19</p>
<p>3   Wesfarmers		  10.00	     8.70</p>
<p>4   Ashton Mining		2.15	     7.50</p>
